# ===== AOG-site .gitignore =====
#
# This repository now contains ONLY the live site, which lives in aog-static/.
#
# The old WordPress installation was removed from the repo in August 2026, once
# the static site was verified to have no dependency on it — it builds and
# serves correctly with wp-content moved out of the tree entirely.
#
# Those files are still present on the local machine as an archive, but they are
# not part of the site and must never be deployed. Two of them matter:
#
#   adminer.sql         the full database export — the only copy of the old
#                       content and of historical form submissions
#   wp-content/uploads  original-resolution images. The site's own copies in
#                       aog-static/public/assets/media were resized for the web,
#                       so this is the only place the originals still exist.
#
# Keep both until the migration is signed off.

# --- The old WordPress installation (not part of the site) ---
# Anchored with a leading slash so these only match at the repository root.
# Without it, ".htaccess" and "robots.txt" would also match the site's own
# copies in aog-static/public/, which are live deploy config and must stay.
/wp-admin/
/wp-includes/
/wp-content/
/wp-*.php
/xmlrpc.php
/index.php
/readme.html
/license.txt
/wp-cli.phar
/robots.txt
/.htaccess
/.user.ini
/.well-known/
/.tmb/
/error_log
/malcare-waf.php

# --- Secrets & credentials ---
/wp-config.php
.env
*.pem
*.key

# --- Database dumps & the standalone admin tool ---
/adminer*.php
*.sql
*.sql.gz

# --- Backups & archives ---
*.wpress
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.gz
*.rar

# --- Logs ---
*.log
debug.log


# --- OS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
._*
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/

# --- Node ---
node_modules/
aog-static/image-picker.html
aog-static/seo-audit.html
